00:00:42.359 --> 00:00:45.359
Say "nice rack."
Nice rack!

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:48.059
You know what'd make this brisket sandwich
even better?

00:00:48.059 --> 00:00:51.260
French fries?
Oh, I love a good deep-fried tater,

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.329
