I dig it.

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:31.470
Well...I can't wait for my birthday.
I'll make you one.

00:01:31.470 --> 00:01:35.670
Oh man. Yeah--no, thanks. Thanks, Banyan.
It's actually pronounced Ban-YAN.

00:01:35.670 --> 00:01:39.800
-Yeah. -Mm-hm. That's what I said.
It's like an emphasis on the end of it.

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:40.510
Ban-YAN.
BanYAN.

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:44.910
BanYAN. "I am not artist, I'm an artiste."
Okay, but he was the worst one.

00:01:44.910 --> 00:01:45.430
No.
Yes, he was.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.950
No, no!
Yes he was!

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:49.650
