Kevin?

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.910
Kevin...
Yeah, I have that photo.

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:55.250
Okay, you know what? This is kind of unfair.
What is this, pick on Robyn day? Come on.

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:57.800
So, I'm just trying to help Robyn
unlock her true potential.

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.900
It's baby steps.
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:03.610
This is the same Robyn who refused to come
to my apartment

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:06.910
